1043
00:33:50,015 --> 00:33:52,356
Start simple, automate what you can,

1044
00:33:52,356 --> 00:33:54,891
and give yourself permission to adjust.

1045
00:33:55,071 --> 00:33:56,929
That's how a budget turns into a

1046
